        "iast": "gajamukhanè siddhidāyakanè",
        "devanagari": "गजमुखनॆ सिद्धिदायकनॆ"
      },
      "composer": "ವ್ಯಾಸರಾಯರು",
      "composer_latin": "V Y A S A R A Y A R U",
      "deity": "",
      "tags": [
